[{"client_msg_id":"35134f01-cda0-4784-b157-312e2a323876","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"flac のタグに使われている Vorbis comment は key-value store で、value には任意のテキストデータを入れられる構造になっていますね。どの key が何に使われるかってのもざっくりは決まっていて、その中に lyrics ってのもある。ただしもちろんソフトが対応していないと意味ない","ts":"1634049234.296000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4hKg2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbfc65ee-9fcf-4ff7-b1ff-7a82657b67fa","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"compinit のキャッシュとコンパイルしたら zsh 起動が爆速になった","ts":"1634049170.295200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6C70"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7daea35d-48a8-4c3a-8f28-c8f85818923c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"なるほど\nspotifyためしに契約してみようかな……","ts":"1634048608.294200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z=V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41520b82-c3cf-4cf4-b710-77e9928235e1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ストリーミングはスマホで聞く場合はアプリを入れておけば Wi-Fi ある環境でまとめてダウンロードして外出先では通信なしで聞けたりはする","ts":"1634048554.293000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RPnEH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47e4fca5-59a0-4794-b806-e87bacd127c7","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ああ、なるほど","ts":"1634048492.291700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nUx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c694ad7-031f-42a3-8fd2-7118ed1e7666","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"コメントフィールドを読んでるはず","ts":"1634048478.291400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TCy6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33821736-f4d9-472f-a1a7-1d5a94907e16","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"規格としてはないんでしたっけ\nプレイヤーがそれぞれオレオレフィールド用意してて、たまたまそれが被ってると読めるのか","ts":"1634048465.291100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"URIHw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c87ca456-65f0-41ae-b71e-74a24a76e0d2","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"とりあえず、今はどのフォーマットのタグ情報も歌詞データ用のフィールドは無いんですよね","ts":"1634048430.290400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wah"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6b6ec5c-cc14-4409-b634-48c92f73d85e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"うぃーふぃーで聞いてる","ts":"1634048390.289400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4zzf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bdb274f-c892-4449-93ff-4508bf111a86","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そんな事ある","ts":"1634048372.288900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gL1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b814bd9-ae9f-431b-9765-8ffdd9925299","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ストリーミングってモバイル通信の契約そこそこデカくないと厳しいイメージあるんですけどもしかしてそんな事はあまりない？","ts":"1634048357.288600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ftVK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cda31ec7-35e4-4edd-b980-eb5677ebe91d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"配信サービスの強みの1つよね。というかダウンロード販売はもうちょっと頑張ってくれ…統一規格作って配信した曲のタグに歌詞を埋め込んで対応ソフトでそれを表示させるくらいの気概をみせてくれないとどんどん人が離れるぞ…","ts":"1634048285.287200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UYy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5edb26c-6307-4149-87e8-c57ee06b58c4","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"Amazon Prime Music も歌詞データついてる曲ならスクロールで表示されますね","ts":"1634048194.285800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5fG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09349794-8ef9-4988-b92a-0eda00486448","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"spotifyの歌詞は曲に連動してスクロールしてくれるところが好き。検索ではそうもいかないですし。","ts":"1634048116.285100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zVBUl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9924e63e-53f1-47c7-a82b-5ad13bc03fb9","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"なお、「曲名 タイムタグ」でググると、歌詞の部分は別の文字が入ってるタイムタグだけのファイルがネット上に上がってたりする","ts":"1634047441.283900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dlz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a42de4b1-5ad7-4cc1-b12b-9ac8bd431f92","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"正しい歌詞が与えられた条件下であれば、今の技術なら再生時刻との紐付けも割と高精度にできそう。","ts":"1634047438.283700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4ySj6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"feeb24eb-255c-44dc-a376-61fa5eafdfd3","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ニコカラでよくカラオケの練習してたな\nまあ一緒に行く人はいなかったんですが","ts":"1634047414.282900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+bb44"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d45d724-4cbd-4b77-abad-7e34a69811f5","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"なお、タイムタグを変換して字幕にして、動画に入れ込んだニコカラ動画を過去に数本作ってるのが私です","ts":"1634047366.281700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xGCn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f611713-7420-4d0b-a889-c0b16cffe0a9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"むかーしすこしやったことがあるw (別のソフトだったけど)\nさすがにだるすぎた","ts":"1634047326.280800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qGHg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bdb111e-53f5-4516-b49e-b28442d6b71a","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://hirodly.com/nicokara-create/rhythmicalyrics-using-137/\u003e\n自分でタイムタグ作りましょ","ts":"1634047200.280200","attachments":[{"fallback":"日々徒然記 | カラオケ動画制作を作り続ける管理人の備忘録: 歌詞にタイムタグを付ける『RhythmicaLyrics』の使い方 | 日々徒然記","id":1